# Scalestorm Summoner: with Barkhide Mauler (a 4/4, power exactly 4) on Bot1's side, attacking makes a 3/1 red Dinosaur token (it just enters, it is not
# attacking). On turn 1 Bot1 casts the Summoner; on turn 3 Black Lotus ({G}{G}{G}) and two Moxes pay for the Mauler, then the Summoner attacks.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Scalestorm Summoner
Barkhide Mauler
Forest
Forest x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

